# SHADOW-CINE-ABORT: Shadows Cinematic with another group at High must not abort the editor
# No scene in Projects/Desert holds a reflection capture; LocalShadows_Room has two shadow-casting point lights,
# which is what the crash needs: the shadow re-budget of a quality change ran AFTER the local lights' views were
# planned in the same frame and destroyed the plan under it (SceneRenderer::OnUpdate).
Дано run Scene "Open Scene LocalShadows_Room.desce"
Дано run Quality "Quality: Shadows High"
Дано run Quality "Quality: GlobalIllumination Epic"
Дано run Quality "Quality: Reflections High"
Когда run Quality "Quality: Shadows Cinematic"
Тогда 0_cine_refl_high комната нарисована с тенями точечных источников, редактор жив (Shadows Cinematic, Reflections High)
Когда run Quality "Quality: GlobalIllumination High"
Тогда 1_cine_gi_high то же: кадр есть, падения нет (Shadows Cinematic, GI High)
Дано run Quality "Quality: Shadows High"
